 coffee, at a great price and we think that once you try it, you're really going to like it. in fact, we think that you 'll like it so much, you 'll want to tell your coffee loving friends. sorry! - - coffee as fresh as north coast's can't be found in any grocery store nor even at most coffee shops. coffee shops have to stock their coffee for the people that shop for it and that means it sits in their stores for weeks, sometimes even longer! at north coast coffee, we roast your coffee when you order it and not before! great coffee is fresh roasted coffee. the freshest coffee ( unless you roast it yourself ) is north coast coffee. so get your free grinder today! click on http : / / www. northcoastcoffee. com / ccrew. htm and soon you'll be drinking the best coffee you have ever tasted! michael shaffer coffee lover and president north coast coffee company",
